  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GMAP3 Enabling Contract</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UK Government&#x2019;s Foreign Commonwealth &amp; Development Office (FCDO) has demonstrated significant commitment to addressing the global problem of landmines and Explosive Remnants of War (ERW).
After GMAP2&apos;s closure this Enabling Contract has seen FCDO commit further funding to retain momentum and provide stability for humanitarian mine action programmes in Angola, Zimbabwe, Cambodia, Somalia and Somaliland.</narrative>
  </description>
